' --- trazabilidad (diagram-traceability-contract) ---
' vista: d16
' governed-by: sldb.target.components
@startuml
title Dependencias y dirección de autoridad

rectangle "Lisp / DSL" as Lisp
rectangle "CLI / UI / Agents" as Clients
rectangle "Projections" as Projections
rectangle "Semantics" as Semantics
rectangle "Hooks and Effects" as Effects
rectangle "Kernel Core" as Core
rectangle "Storage Traits" as Storage
rectangle "Storage Implementation" as Backend

Lisp --> Core : compila a operaciones
Clients --> Core : comandos y consultas
Projections --> Core : leen revisiones
Semantics --> Projections : datos derivados
Effects --> Core : registran resultados

Core --> Storage
Storage --> Backend

note bottom of Core
Único componente autorizado
para producir nuevas revisiones.
end note

note right of Lisp
Extensible, pero no controla
directamente la persistencia.
end note

@enduml
